{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped at the table, the gambler was horrified to discover that the dice suddenly came alive and rushed towards him. Only by holding his cards tightly and smashing all the dice that attacked him could he escape alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand Card</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only hold a maximum of five cards at a time, and the basic damage of each card is equal to the points on the card.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Suit Bonus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have three or more cards of the same suit, you will receive a bonus effect. The more cards of the same suit you have, the higher the bonus effect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape Bonus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different shapes bring different bonus effects. After obtaining a Royal Flush, you can unlock powerful skills.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034040?t=1758931790","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034040/88eeee0ac4baa56e2d0545f7e10be4dfe79c4640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758931790","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034040/f2c885171b7ecc87cf1b3b4c6792645796fc615a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758931790","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034040/f2c885171b7ecc87cf1b3b4c6792645796fc615a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758931790","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped at the table, the gambler was horrified to discover that the dice suddenly came alive and rushed towards him. Only by holding his cards tightly and smashing all the dice that attacked him could he escape alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand Card</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only hold a maximum of five cards at a time, and the basic damage of each card is equal to the points on the card.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Suit Bonus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have three or more cards of the same suit, you will receive a bonus effect. The more cards of the same suit you have, the higher the bonus effect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape Bonus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different shapes bring different bonus effects. After obtaining a Royal Flush, you can unlock powerful skills.</p>","developers":["October Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034040/e3898f63415b066ecd83e8dcd12d6172e223eb1c/header.jpg?t=1758931790","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034040/598348235/6a8d56812b4310fb5ea20231f7a63f23a73d1c41/1757818709/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758268540","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034040/598348235/6a8d56812b4310fb5ea20231f7a63f23a73d1c41/1757818709/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758268540","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034040/598348235/6a8d56812b4310fb5ea20231f7a63f23a73d1c41/1757818709/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758268540","id":257197448,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197448/movie480.mp4?t=1758268540","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197448/movie_max.mp4?t=1758268540"},"name":"video3","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257197448/d3f7d3ff64a8ea2188ee3bf444152f8ebf014e0a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758268540","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197448/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758268540","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197448/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758268540"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034040/1